            "review_title": "Review at Nhà hàng chay Bụt Việt - Đống Đa",
            "review_text": "Lee W\nBarnsley, United Kingdom38 contributions\n0\nLocal food, World class\nMar 2025 • Couples\nMe and the Wife ate here tonight 14 March 25. This V/VE restraunt is excellent. Really great tasting food. The Tofu skins were superb. Place was full of locals which tells you all you need to know. 337000vnd = £10.20 we had. 2x cokes 1 x sticky rice, 1x fried special noodle, 1x Tofu skins in a rich sauce, 1x califonia rolls (like steamed spring rolls) with a peanut sauce. 1x Silken Tofu in a spicy sauce..\n\nAmazing 👏\nRead more\nWritten March 14, 2025",
